Prior art
---------
This plugin is a new implementation, written from scratch. It does not copy code
from the earlier community MAX plugins, but it learned from them and from their
users' issue reports:

* Realmagnum/hermes-max-integration ("max-platform"), MIT,
  Copyright (c) 2026 Realmagnum / Hermes Agent community — in particular where MAX
  puts upload tokens (audio/video in POST /uploads, images in "photos"), the
  attachment.not.ready retry, and binding interactive buttons to the person whose
  turn raised them.
* vladimiraldushin/hermes-max-platform, MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Vladimir Aldushin —
  the first MAX adapter for Hermes.

Bundled data
------------
assets/certs/russian_trusted_root_ca.pem is the public "Russian Trusted Root CA"
certificate of the Ministry of Digital Development, Communications and Mass Media
of the Russian Federation (valid until 2032-02-27). It is a public trust anchor,
not covered by the MIT License of this project.

docs/index.html contains a dependency-free animated flow-diagram engine adapted for
this project's diagram.
